forgekit (0.3.4-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release of ForgeKit as Debian package
  * Go CLI for generating, managing, analyzing and diagnosing backend APIs
  * Hexagonal architecture with PostgreSQL, Docker, migrations
  * Feature system: auth, cors, logging, swagger
  * Architecture validation: doctor, check, analyze, inspect
  * Provides backward-compatible 'forge' symlink

